.cache/

# Session-local layers. This mirrors engram's own model: the transferable
# layers (semantic, procedural, traps, vision) are durable project knowledge
# and are tracked; the session layers are working state and raw transcripts,
# and are not. See the `transferable` and `session` sets in lib/layers.py.
active/
lossless/

